  message: "WORK DONE (decontend run 10032026, stage 8) on local branch jgstern-agent/fix/hilum, commits 179d46a25f (core) + 2228166597 (nim). Not pushed.\n\nAsk 3 (arity): each proc/func/method records meta[\"parameters\"]; _NimScope.lookup counts arguments (UFCS receiver = first; ': block'/do = one more) and the first visibility tier with an admitting declaration decides; several = ambiguous (resolution_quality stamped, 1/sqrt(N) kept); none = unresolved. A qualified call no module declaration can take is retried as UFCS.\nAsk 1 (types), done ANALYZER-SIDE, not via receiver_type_dispatch: where the first argument's type is DECLARED in the proc (parameter, result's return type, typed var/let), a candidate whose first parameter provably cannot take it is dropped (_NimTypes; generics, type classes, library types, conflicted names never exclude). Why not the D facet's route: that linker matches an exact base-type string, so a typed receiver whose declared type is an alias, a subtype or a generic instance of the parameter type would lose its true edge; exclusion-on-proof keeps those.\nAsk 2 (untyped receivers): kept binding (no withhold); the arity + type filters already remove the measured misbinds that have a typed receiver, and no A/B of a withholding arm was run.\n\nMeasured by call site on nitter 8114eef / nim-chronos c679d29 / pixie 30bb510 / nimble 33a6bc8: 4,543 sites that were 1/sqrt(N) guesses on dev (my count -- the description's 1,657 used a definition I could not reproduce) -> 947 unique (515 moved), 206 unresolved, 3,390 still ambiguous and stamped. nitter types.add* binds 64 -> 26 (the 26: 19 field chains, 4 inferred locals, 1 module-level var, 2 where the 2nd argument decides). Self-call sites: nitter 9->7, chronos 77->53, pixie 52->47, nimble 97->88. Read: every type-based exclusion on nimble (13), pixie (1), nitter (49); 25 of 52 on chronos.\n\nTests: test_nim_overload_arity.py (12); board smart-test 13352 passed, 0 failed, 100% coverage on changed files.\nResidual filed: WI-gudav-gufof-tasog-jatun-gipok-zolom-rutug-batob (type check reads only proc-local declared first-argument types, P3)."  # 4725
